 "lines": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "start": 0.5,
   "duration": 4.994,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_01",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_01",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/01.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/01.mp3",
    "duration": 4.994
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Тысячу лет назад спасли они Ольм, пожертвовав собой.",
    "en": "A thousand years ago they saved Howlem by sacrificing themselves.",
    "fr": "Il y a des milliers d'années, ils ont sauvé Howlem en se sacrifiant."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169543"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "start": 6.494,
   "duration": 5.177,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_02",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_02",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/02.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/02.mp3",
    "duration": 5.177
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Но ничто не исчезает на совсем, они всё ещё здесь, в Древе…",
    "en": "But nothing disappears completely, they are still here in the Tree...",
    "fr": "Mais rien ne disparaît complètement, ils sont toujours ici, dans l'Arbre..."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169544"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "start": 12.671,
   "duration": 3.583,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_03",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_03",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/03.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/03.mp3",
    "duration": 3.583
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Они были со своим народом, видели его радости и беды…",
    "en": "They were with their people, saw their joys and troubles...",
    "fr": "Ils étaient avec leur peuple et furent témoins de leurs joies et de leurs problèmes."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169545"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "start": 17.254,
   "duration": 4.235,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_04",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_04",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/04.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/04.mp3",
    "duration": 4.235
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Достаточно лишь позвать… Я чувствую, они откликнутся…",
    "en": "It is enough just to call... They will respond, I can feel it...",
    "fr": "C'est assez pour appeler... Ils répondront, je peux le sentir..."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169546"
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "start": 22.489,
   "duration": 5.998,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_05",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_05",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/05.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/05.mp3",
    "duration": 5.998
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Ты была быстрой, словно молния, но теперь ты крепко спишь, Валь. Прости.",
    "en": "You were fast as lightning, but now you are fast asleep, Val. I'm sorry.",
    "fr": "Vous étiez rapide comme l'éclair, mais maintenant, vous êtes rapidement endormi, Val. Pardon."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169547"
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "start": 29.487,
   "duration": 7.48,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_06",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_06",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/06.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/06.mp3",
    "duration": 7.48
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Ты видел вершины самых высоких гор, но вечные грёзы объяли тебя, Орн. Прости.",
    "en": "You have seen the peaks of the highest mountains, but eternal dreams have seized you, Orn. I'm sorry.",
    "fr": "Vous avez contemplé les sommets des plus hautes montagnes, mais les rêves éternels se sont emparés de vous, Orn. Pardon."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169548"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "start": 37.967,
   "duration": 8.085,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_07",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_07",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/07.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/07.mp3",
    "duration": 8.085
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Я чувствую… живую Нить, зовущую меня на помощь…",
    "en": "I feel... a living Thread calling for help...",
    "fr": "Je sens... un Fil vivant qui appelle à l'aide..."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169549"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "start": 47.052,
   "duration": 4.854,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_08",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceSay_08",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/08.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/08.mp3",
    "duration": 4.854
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Бьётся словно сердце… Но нужно больше силы, иначе не вытянуть.",
    "en": "It beats like a heart... But we need more power, otherwise I won’t be able to pull it out.",
    "fr": "Il bat comme un cœur... Mais nous avons besoin de plus de puissance, sinon je ne pourrai pas le retirer."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169550"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "start": 52.906,
   "duration": 4.322,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceGotHelpSay_01",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceGotHelpSay_01",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/09.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/09.mp3",
    "duration": 4.322
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Да, я вижу очертания, словно сквозь туман… Но нужно ещё силы.",
    "en": "Yes, I see the outlines, as though through a fog... But more power is needed.",
    "fr": "Oui, je vois les contours, comme dans le brouillard. Mais il me faut plus de puissance."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169592"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "start": 58.228,
   "duration": 7.874,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceGotHelpSay_02",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceGotHelpSay_02",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/10.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/10.mp3",
    "duration": 7.874
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Да, это белка, теперь я вижу силуэт. Она спит и чтобы пробудить её нужна ещё сила.",
    "en": "Yes, it's a squirrel - I see the silhouette now. It's sleeping. I need more power to wake it up.",
    "fr": "Oui, c'est un écureuil, je vois sa silhouette maintenant. Il dort. J'ai besoin de plus de puissance pour le réveiller."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169593"
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "start": 67.102,
   "duration": 8.576,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceGotHelpSay_03",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_4_UnnTranceGotHelpSay_03",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/11.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/11.mp3",
    "duration": 8.576
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Она… пробудилась. Рататоск! Белка, что скачет по великому Ясеню.",
    "en": "It… woke up. Ratatoskr! The squirrel that jumps between the branches of the Great Ash Tree.",
    "fr": "Il... s'est réveillé. Ratatoskr ! L'écureuil qui saute de branche en branche dans les frondaisons du Grand frêne !"
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169594"
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "start": 76.678,
   "duration": 14.207,
   "speaker": "unn",
   "voice": {
    "event": "/Cutscenes/Isa/Isa_Prologue_Unn_TranceEnd",
    "wave": "Isa_Prologue_Unn_TranceEnd",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_Isa3_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/12.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/12.mp3",
    "duration": 14.207
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "С богиней поговорить мы можем! Чувствую я, что Древо своим сознанием обладает и связаны мысли его с ней. Но непросто сие сделать будет, ох, непросто…",
    "en": "We can speak with the goddess! I can sense that the Tree has its own mind and its thoughts are linked with hers. But it won't be easy...",
    "fr": "Nous pouvons parler à la déesse ! Je peux sentir que l'Arbre à son propre esprit et que ses pensées sont liées aux siennes. Mais cela ne sera pas facile..."
   },
   "source": "ClientData res:740169123"
  }
 ],
